# Node & Package Managers
**/node_modules
**/.npm
**/.yarn
**/.pnpm-store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Production Build Outputs (Avoid copying host builds into containers)
**/build
**/dist

# Environment Files & Local Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
backend/config/config.env

# Git & Version Control
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Docker Specific Files (Prevent recursive context copies)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# Documentation & Markdown
**/*.md
LICENSE

